well, i've noticed a couple things that would explain this, if you've
polymorphed into something else.  dogs and cats seem to lose hit points
(and max hit points) at a fairly rapid rate once they get hungry enough.
eating cures it.

also, water-dwelling creatures like eels and kraken lose hit points
when out of the water for awhile, though i'm not sure they lose max
hit points.  my little dog once turned into a kraken (with 500+ Hp),
but he then died ~400 turns later.  there weren't any pools around
for him to move into, i'm afraid.

